# PHP standards

## Compatibility & typing

- Prefer modern, forward-compatible PHP with **parameter, return, and property types** wherever practical.
- Avoid deprecated features; follow current PHP best practices for the project's supported version.

## File header

At the top of each file, add a file reference (immediately after the opening tag when present):

```php
<?php
# --- file: src/Service/StateManager.php ---
```

## Comments

- Update existing comments when code changes.
- Keep existing comments; remove them only when they are no longer valid.
- Never leave orphaned comments.
- Add comments generously for clarity and programmer context.
